** Open Source
- [[hxxps://aws.amazon.com/blogs/database/introducing-strands-dynamodb-storage-durable-agent-storage-for-the-strands-agents-sdk/][Introducing strands-dynamodb-storage: Durable agent storage for the Strands Agents SDK]] (AWS) — Apache-2.0 backend для Strands Agents SDK хранит session state, long-term memory и transcripts в одной DynamoDB table, используя point reads и prefix queries.
- [[hxxps://www.kdnuggets.com/this-python-library-can-run-pandas-workloads-up-to-20x-faster][This Python Library Can Run Pandas Workloads Up to 20x Faster]] (KDnuggets) — FireDucks предлагает lazy execution, compiler optimization и multithreading для pandas-подобных workloads, но результат нужно валидировать на реальных DataFrame-паттернах.
- [[hxxps://www.warpstream.com/blog/announcing-bento-the-open-source-fork-of-the-project-formerly-known-as-benthos][Announcing Bento, the open source fork of the project formerly known as Benthos - WarpStream]] (WarpStream) — MIT-licensed fork Benthos сохраняет stream-processing connectors без feature gating и license traps, что важно для self-hosted или VPC-контейнерованных пайплайнов.
