- [[hxxps://www.kdnuggets.com/quantifying-user-behavior-patterns-to-build-better-predictive-features][Quantifying User Behavior Patterns to Build Better Predictive Features]] (KDnuggets) — Практичный материал про превращение сырых events в sequence-aware predictive features вместо поверхностных demographic profiles, применимый к churn, fraud и security modeling.
- [[hxxps://www.kdnuggets.com/5-real-world-applications-of-agentic-ai-in-enterprise-automation][5 Real-World Applications of Agentic AI in Enterprise Automation]] (KDnuggets) — Даёт карту применения agentic AI в SRE, finance, legal, migration и security с упором на deterministic safety constraints, что помогает отделять production automation от демо.
- [[hxxps://deepmind.google/blog/proactive-cyber-defense-for-governments-and-enterprises/][Proactive cyber defense for governments and enterprises]] (Google DeepMind) — Показывает направление на AI-assisted cyber defense; стоит читать, если в roadmap есть security automation, threat detection или government-compliance workloads.
